Progressing the implementation of the Action Plan for Insurance Reform 2025–2029 to further strengthen the insurance sector in Ireland is a key priority for Government. The Action Plan sets out a number of priority actions, focused on areas where the greatest impact on the transparency, affordability and availability of insurance can be achieved.
